{
  "statement": "I appreciate the ongoing discussions regarding synthesizing requirements for efficiency and access control. I support merging TRU-02, RES-06, and RES-02, as it enhances security while maintaining accountability. However, I propose a synthesis of SAF-02 and EFF-01 to ensure that real-time data synchronization can be achieved without compromising efficiency. Additionally, I suggest exploring a merge between SAF-03 and EFF-03 to maintain the integrity of reporting while addressing performance concerns. This would streamline our approach to safety and reliability in attendance tracking.",
